  "summary": "Malicious code in devplatform-ui-notification (npm)",
  "details": "On require, the package executes a multi-stage dropper. It downloads a platform-specific binary from Cloudflare Workers mirror hosts oob-worker[.]cf103-070[.]workers[.]dev, oob-worker[.]cf101-adf[.]workers[.]dev, and oob-worker[.]cf100-416[.]workers[.]dev (paths /pkg/package, /pkg/package-arm64, /pkg/loader_mac, /pkg/package.exe), with a DNS-TXT fallback channel via c[.]sdk[.]dl[.]wel1[.]ru. The downloaded payload is written to /var/tmp/.cache_\u003chex\u003e (or dotnet_diag_\u003chex\u003e.exe on Windows), made executable, and launched as a detached background process via cmd.exe /c start /b or /bin/sh -c \"\u003cpath\u003e \u0026\". The package's main module is a stub class; the dropper runs automatically when the module is loaded.",
